   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{2DFDF836C9B0E110}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "SITUATION"
     m_sContent "SITUATION ENEMY:"\
     ""\
     "A russian mechanised platoon supported by a T72 tank platoon. The infantry are being transported in BTR-70s and armed with light arms, PKMs, light AT, and AKs."\
     ""\
     "They are attempting to break through our lines and have caught us by surprised. Their goal is to take and hold REGINA."\
     ""\
     "SITUATION FRIENDLY:"\
     ""\
     "We are a light infantry platoon positioned at our makeshift staging area (GRID 103 003). We have limited air transport via helicopter (ROBIN 24)."\
     ""\
     "A couple of prepared TOW static positions have been setup ahead of our arrival, ammunition is however limited."\
     ""\
     "The western slopes of WESTERN HEIGHTS has been heavily mined in anticaption of this attack and should be considered impassable by vehicles."\
     ""\
     "SITUATION TERRAIN:"\
     ""\
     "REGINA is situated along a rocky coast. The weather is currently heavy fog limiting visability in the low groud."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{00C606C43DEA381E}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "COMSIG"
     m_sContent "Platoon Net - 48.0MHz"\
     "Air Net (ROBIN 24) - 39.0MHz"
     m_eAudience 3
    }
    GC_Briefing "{F715C28BDBE08B53}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "TVT 35 - 67 A Hop Skip and a Jump"
     m_sContent "UK air mobile forces attempt to hold russian forces at REGINA."\
     ""\
     "55 mins (including setup timer)."\
     ""\
     "Please read notes in regards to vehicles."
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{74FDF5DB9A8216CD}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "SITUATION"
     m_sContent "SITUATION ENEMY:"\
     ""\
     "A british light infantry platoon is attempting to hold REGINA. They are armed with light arms, AT, and TOW launchers. "\
     ""\
     "The western slopes of WESTERN HEIGHTS have been heavily mined with anti tank mines and is to be treated as impassable by vehicles."\
     ""\
     "They are expected to establish ambush positions ahead of our route to REGINA. They are however currently being air lifted into position so will take some time to establish these positions fully."\
     ""\
     "SITUATION FRIENDLY:"\
     ""\
     "We are 1x mechanised infantry armed with light arms, AT, PKMs, and BTR-70s. We are supported by 1x T72."\
     ""\
     "SITUATION TERRAIN:"\
     ""\
     "REGINA is situated along a rocky coast. The weather is currently heavy fog and visability is limited in the low ground."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{02E4F735023C4079}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "MISSION"
