    GC_Briefing "{55A14DA56944D443}" {
     m_iOrder 11
     m_sTitle "TOW NOTES (PLEASE READ)"
     m_sContent "The tow can be rearmed but in order to do so you need to have a replacement tube and it NEEDS TO BE EQUIPED in order to get the reload interaction prompt. This is similar to how mortars work."\
     ""\
     "Also note that the TOW takes a second to launch after the trigger has been pressed so be patient. :)"
